## Output contract

- Master lecture: add one morphology pass before the eight-step analysis.
- I1–I5: retain current lesson flow; add a short morphology card and one exercise.
- Decks: use the same vocabulary order; structural openers remain geometrical.
- Student-facing language stays descriptive before semantic and critical claims.
